#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:1
#: 0b01d0ccafa74e839f69aa3bfddb5f2f
msgid "候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT"
msgstr "Clean Candidate Structures Before DFT"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:3
#: 6230949a7ed6404aae1273c15a342ce7
msgid ""
"这条流程适合处理 `生成数据集` 生成的大批候选结构。目标不是在本地得到最终训练"
"标签， 而是在 DFT 之前删掉明显不值得计算的结构，避免把计算资源花在坏构型和重"
"复构型上。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:6
#: a74a02f2c1414443b0bc5e6f3cf24882
msgid "一条稳妥路线是："
msgstr "A robust sequence is:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:8
#: 9341930f33a04413b640b297e5696571
msgid ""
"弛豫好的初始结构\n"
"-> 生成数据集 生成候选结构\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display 查看和清洗异常结构\n"
"-> FPS Filter 或其他采样方法选择代表结构\n"
"-> DFT 标注\n"
"-> GPUMD 训练\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:17
#: 4b0e89d907f346a88287d661095d3c4a
msgid "1. 从初始结构开始"
msgstr "Step 1: Start from trusted structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:19
#: ac27c6c30ad4407b9ad9af3a56ec9737
msgid ""
"先准备一批可信的初始结构。它们通常来自已有训练集、弛豫后的晶体、表面模型、缺"
"陷模型或手工构建的原型。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare a trusted set of starting structures, typically from an existing "
"training set, relaxed crystals, surface or defect models, or manually "
"constructed prototypes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:21
#: 9339b8791756426f84f65f6c38360dd6
msgid ""
"在 `生成数据集` 页面，先用顶部 `Open` 导入这些初始结构，再添加生成卡片。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:23
#: 2222d64e7a414baa979660effc23ecb0
msgid "生成数据集 input and workspace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:23
#: 2222d64e7a414baa979660effc23ecb0
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/make_data_empty.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:28
#: abb77b456b6141a69b3228a60d35f4c6
msgid ""
"这一步不要跳过。没有初始结构时，大多数构型生成卡没有明确的处理对象；即使某些"
"生成卡能从零创建结构， 也应该单独确认它的输出是否符合你要研究的材料体系。"
msgstr ""
"Do not skip this step. Most configuration cards have no object to process "
"without an input structure. Even when a generator can start from scratch, "
"independently verify that its output represents the material system under "
"study."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:31
#: 01aa17c633c14550a6f68608fc974a52
msgid "2. 生成候选结构，不要急着 DFT"
msgstr "Step 2: Generate candidates before scheduling DFT"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:33
#: 077711ab0b4d4a49a77d43fcdda82a8a
msgid "`生成数据集` 负责把初始结构扩展成候选池。例如："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:35
#: b3ed2e96396b42929f0573f682932f93
msgid "`Lattice Strain` / `Shear Strain`：补应变附近结构。"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` / `Shear Strain`: add structures along strain coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:36
#: 92fb1ac783a44454b68abc5f9e92dbfd
msgid "`Atomic Perturb` / `Vibration Perturb`：补近平衡扰动。"
msgstr ""
"`Atomic Perturb` / `Vibration Perturb`: add near-equilibrium displacements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:37
#: 5c38adb111914f98ad6a3335eeb09fa9
msgid "`Random Vacancy` / `Vacancy Defect` / `Insert Defect`：补缺陷环境。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Vacancy` / `Vacancy Defect` / `Insert Defect`: add defect "
"environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:38
#: d33af31d1c6147449ed2e88f6df4494d
msgid "`Random Slab` / `Stacking Fault`：补表面和层错。"
msgstr "`Random Slab` / `Stacking Fault`: add surfaces and stacking faults."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:39
#: f93bc234587344f09dfdb9d1c7ec3250
msgid "`Random Doping` / `Random Occupancy`：补合金或占位变化。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` / `Random Occupancy`: vary alloy composition or site "
"occupation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:41
#: a069c5e97bb242a0a261f8fe8820380f
msgid ""
"这些操作会扩大覆盖，但也会引入坏结构。比如扰动过大导致原子距离过近，随机占位"
"产生极端局部环境， 表面或缺陷生成后出现不合理配位。候选结构应该先导出为一个中"
"间文件，例如 `candidate_pool.xyz`，再进入下一步清洗。"
msgstr ""
"These operations improve coverage but can also create invalid structures: "
"excessive perturbations may place atoms too close, random occupation may "
"create extreme local environments, and surfaces or defects may have "
"unreasonable coordination. Export the candidates to an intermediate file "
"such as `candidate_pool.xyz` before cleaning them."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:45
#: 7438ce3e7afd4221b92fd247f6cfacb2
msgid "3. 在 NEP Dataset Display 里先看结构"
msgstr "Step 3: Inspect structures in NEP Dataset Display"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:47
#: b47b7445e50f483bb1d172b874669ce8
msgid ""
"把 `candidate_pool.xyz` 导入 `NEP Dataset Display`。这一步先做肉眼和几何层面"
"的检查："
msgstr ""
"Import `candidate_pool.xyz` into `NEP Dataset Display` and begin with visual "
"and geometric checks:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:49
#: 9082be804eeb45c8b076ddeed69f6083
msgid "结构是否明显破碎或重叠。"
msgstr "Look for visibly fragmented or overlapping structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:50
#: bab0085094ed42afb3e56ba1e4ae2b87
msgid "元素组成是否符合预期。"
msgstr "Confirm that elemental compositions are expected."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:51
#: 03ac8dc43f704aef86bb03b4048a6ad5
msgid "`Config_type` 是否能追溯到生成来源。"
msgstr "Confirm that `Config_type` identifies the generation source."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:52
#: 91ee79a0f8cb4b79b898b4ec17f55138
msgid "是否存在明显过短键长或非物理局部环境。"
msgstr ""
"Look for clearly short interatomic distances or nonphysical local "
"environments."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:54
#: 427a138de8c94ca7a71b3f9df6f2be16
msgid "NEP Dataset Display candidate inspection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:54
#: 427a138de8c94ca7a71b3f9df6f2be16
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_overview.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:59
#: fcb765409a6e4d2985441d3e7f9d1fbe
msgid "建议先用这些工具："
msgstr "Start with these tools:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:61
#: d2a01d6a3ec1428dab1e6633ada8d7a9
msgid "`Finding non-physical structures`：按近邻距离快速找疑似坏构型。"
msgstr ""
"`Finding non-physical structures`: quickly flag suspicious configurations by "
"nearest-neighbor distance."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:62
#: 8ed4939966ae49969b8dec7bbcf89466
msgid "`Select by Range`：按图上范围选择异常点。"
msgstr "`Select by Range`: select outliers in a plotted range."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:63
#: b6165fd89e814cc59eb769ff4e8ceb69
msgid "`Find Max Error Point`：在有参考或预测结果时定位最极端样本。"
msgstr ""
"`Find Max Error Point`: locate the most extreme samples when reference or "
"prediction results are available."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:64
#: 1752b1f9f0a242b08407f8505410981b
msgid "搜索框：按 `Config_type`、元素或表达式筛某一类结构。"
msgstr ""
"Search box: isolate a structure family by `Config_type`, element, or "
"expression."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:65
#: 547b1fe6aed24ea797406e606b19f001
msgid "`Delete Selected Items` / `Undo Delete`：删除和撤销。"
msgstr ""
"`Delete Selected Items` / `Undo Delete`: remove structures or restore the "
"last deletion."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:67
#: 0481bf4d57f44a928de6e29ca1a417ab
msgid "4. 用 NEP 预测做快速预筛"
msgstr "Step 4: Prescreen with NEP predictions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:69
#: 9f6c8aae8b88438a89d928b28a88b3b5
msgid ""
"如果你有可用的预筛模型，可以让 `NEP Dataset Display` 给候选结构做快速预测。 "
"这里的预测值不是 DFT 标签，也不能当作训练真值；它只用于发现明显离谱的候选样"
"本。"
msgstr ""
"If a suitable prescreening model is available, use `NEP Dataset Display` to "
"predict the candidate pool. These predictions are neither DFT labels nor "
"training ground truth. They serve only to reveal clearly implausible "
"candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:72
#: c1dbc0cb9e704915b88fb402d80663f7
msgid "常见判断包括："
msgstr "Useful warning signs include:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:74
#: 27bfd2ae58de426f938dca52184f04eb
msgid "某些结构预测力远高于同批样本，大概率有过近原子或极端局部环境。"
msgstr ""
"A structure with predicted forces far above the rest of the batch likely "
"contains atoms that are too close or another extreme local environment."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:75
#: f0f2db563f9a4e1786a6286258b5158f
msgid "能量分布出现孤立长尾，需要回到结构视图确认。"
msgstr ""
"An isolated long tail in the energy distribution should be inspected in the "
"structure view."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:76
#: eae39682a2cb4d3ab72803bf7619a226
msgid "某一类 `Config_type` 系统性异常，说明上游卡片参数可能过激。"
msgstr ""
"A systematic anomaly within one `Config_type` may indicate overly aggressive "
"parameters in the upstream card."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:78
#: 9f0065931e844f9ca59911067c4b78e3
msgid ""
"如果没有可信预筛模型，也不要强行依赖预测值。先做几何检查和人工抽查，再保守地"
"缩小生成参数。"
msgstr ""
"Without a trustworthy prescreening model, do not force a decision from "
"predictions. Use geometric checks and manual spot checks, then "
"conservatively narrow the generation parameters."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:80
#: 48bbe636607944a094ac6aa95a6f4629
msgid "5. 先清洗，再 FPS"
msgstr "Step 5: Clean before applying FPS"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:82
#: 2240009e3d6441f9aa5c8253bd9986dc
msgid "`FPS Filter` 的作用是从候选池里选代表结构，不是判断结构是否物理合理。"
msgstr ""
"`FPS Filter` selects representative structures from a candidate pool; it "
"does not judge physical plausibility."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:84
#: aabdda6d125d4ca79f8331d6819da84a
msgid ""
"如果候选池里混入很多坏结构，直接 FPS 会有一个风险：坏结构在描述符空间里往往很"
"“远”， 因此可能被优先选中。结果看起来覆盖更广，实际却把 DFT 预算花在不该算的"
"结构上。"
msgstr ""
"Applying FPS directly to a contaminated pool is risky. Invalid structures "
"are often far from normal samples in descriptor space and may therefore be "
"selected first. The result appears diverse while spending the DFT budget on "
"structures that should have been rejected."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:87
#: 455cbd200e7d4cd492844c582ede32a7
msgid "更稳的顺序是："
msgstr "Use this order instead:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:89
#: a14fa02c1d594ab1a0f1c01581897789
msgid ""
"候选池\n"
"-> 删除明显坏结构\n"
"-> 删除或隔离预测力极大的结构\n"
"-> 检查每类 Config_type 是否还保留足够样本\n"
"-> 再用 FPS Filter 做代表性采样\n"
msgstr ""
"Candidate pool\n"
"-> Remove clearly invalid structures\n"
"-> Remove or quarantine structures with extreme predicted forces\n"
"-> Confirm that every `Config_type` still has enough samples\n"
"-> Apply FPS Filter for representative sampling\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:97
#: efe6dcf99206457cb159aa57ae75c1b3
msgid ""
"清洗后的输出可以命名为 `candidate_pool_clean.xyz`。如果之后做 FPS，输出可以命"
"名为 `candidate_pool_fps.xyz`，这样每一步都能追溯。"
msgstr ""
"Name the cleaned output `candidate_pool_clean.xyz` and a subsequent FPS "
"result `candidate_pool_fps.xyz` so every stage remains traceable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:100
#: 5a94e95b099948e3b65e44f30b08fc32
msgid "6. 送去 DFT 后再回看"
msgstr "Step 6: Review again after DFT"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:102
#: d61f66f054de45f28186db28ba6d7c24
msgid ""
"DFT 标注完成后，把带有能量、力、应力的结构再导入 `NEP Dataset Display`。 这时"
"检查重点会变化："
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling, import the structures with energies, forces, and "
"stresses back into `NEP Dataset Display`. The review now shifts to:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:105
#: 67b7b7a3f4804faca0090dd1e4a67652
msgid "是否有 DFT 未收敛或异常标签。"
msgstr "Unconverged DFT calculations or anomalous labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:106
#: 073d00dbda414449ad50fceac4bb8128
msgid "力和能量分布是否出现不合理长尾。"
msgstr "Unreasonable long tails in force or energy distributions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:107
#: 1b67cdc798d44604a8cba8b66b6e0fdc
msgid "某些构型族是否过多或过少。"
msgstr "Overrepresented or underrepresented configuration families."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:108
#: 5468456cb32e447580388ee623313c06
msgid "训练后模型在哪些结构上误差最大。"
msgstr "The structures on which the trained model has its largest errors."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:110
#: 7c838298f1c64257a051795dbcd2379b
msgid ""
"这一步的输出会决定下一轮 `生成数据集` 应该补什么：是补某类缺陷、某个应变范"
"围， 还是缩小某张生成卡的参数范围。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:113
#: 38d92f95d7c74fa496dc1c2fa4731ae6
msgid "常见误区"
msgstr "Common mistakes"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:115
#: 219714bb0986449abfe3dc760cfb16ff
msgid ""
"**误区 1：生成后直接 DFT。** 候选结构不是最终训练集。先清洗通常比事后处理失"
"败 DFT 更省时间。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 1: Run DFT immediately after generation.** Candidates are not a "
"finished training set. Cleaning first usually costs less than diagnosing "
"failed DFT calculations later."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:118
#: 012d64122fa4418094e66bea64a8f35a
msgid ""
"**误区 2：先 FPS 再清洗。** FPS 不知道物理合理性，只知道描述符距离。坏结构可"
"能因为“特别不一样”被选中。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 2: Apply FPS before cleaning.** FPS measures descriptor distance, "
"not physical plausibility. An invalid structure may be selected precisely "
"because it is unusually different."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:121
#: abc824cb48404f68b1cbab7f774ab46a
msgid ""
"**误区 3：把 NEP 预测当作 DFT 标签。** NEP 预测只适合预筛和排序，最终训练标签"
"仍然来自 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 3: Treat NEP predictions as DFT labels.** NEP predictions are "
"suitable for prescreening and ranking; final training labels still come from "
"DFT."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md:124
#: 099fcba7c2874f1eac1204eaaa0126b4
msgid ""
"**误区 4：只看总数量。** 候选池有 5000 个结构不等于覆盖好。更重要的是每类 "
"`Config_type` 的质量和多样性。"
msgstr ""
"**Mistake 4: Judge only by total count.** A pool of 5,000 structures does "
"not guarantee useful coverage. The quality and diversity within each "
"`Config_type` matter more."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这条流程适合处理 `Make Dataset` 生成的大批候选结构。目标不是在本地得到最终"
#~ "训练标签， 而是在 DFT 之前删掉明显不值得计算的结构，避免把计算资源花在坏构"
#~ "型和重复构型上。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use this workflow for a large candidate pool generated by `Make Dataset`. "
#~ "The goal is not to create final training labels locally. It is to remove "
#~ "structures that clearly do not justify a DFT calculation, avoiding wasted "
#~ "compute on invalid or redundant configurations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "弛豫好的初始结构\n"
#~ "-> Make Dataset 生成候选结构\n"
#~ "-> NEP Dataset Display 查看和清洗异常结构\n"
#~ "-> FPS Filter 或其他采样方法选择代表结构\n"
#~ "-> DFT 标注\n"
#~ "-> GPUMD 训练\n"
#~ msgstr ""
